abstract: >-
  A research-oriented lifelong-learning system with one shared mentalization core.
  It uses strict eight-function-attitude entry, a dynamic Big Five pulse, a world-tree
  projection and authorized shared branches to support objective, subjective and
  person-to-person learning contexts.